when you install Solaris10 fresh it will just have pkgadd ..  (you want to use opencsw and blastwave packages)

do this 
pkgadd -d http://mirror.opencsw.org/opencsw/pkgutil-`uname -p`.pkg

this will install pkgutil under /opt/csw/bin

thats it pkgutil -i package_name (from opencsw.org) to do the rest

I m told this is also compatible with blastwave never tested it though
